Meridian Utility Systems - Aquilon 7.1 / Trellis 4.2 media label

  trexport        settlement exporter; reads a .tdu v4 unload and writes the
                  TCANON v2 interchange stream to standard output
  libaquilon.so   rating and formatting runtime used by trexport and by the
                  nightly rate daemon

trexport loads libaquilon.so from its own directory.  The vendor_release.manifest
file shipped with this media records the size and SHA-256 of the release library;
an appliance copy must verify against it before the runtime is started.

Support for Aquilon 7 ended on 2021-06-30.  There is no update channel.